# ==============================================================================
# PC Dost India — Server-Side Retailer API Environment Variables
# ==============================================================================
#
# IMPORTANT SECURITY NOTICE:
# - These variables are strictly for server-side use only.
# - DO NOT prefix these with NEXT_PUBLIC_ or expose them in client components.
# - If these credentials are not set, PC Dost India gracefully falls back to the
#   built-in local catalog and authenticated search links without breaking any
#   builder, compatibility, recommendation, or comparison features.
# ==============================================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Amazon Associates / Creators API (Product Advertising API 5.0 - India)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Register / obtain at: https://affiliate-program.amazon.in/assoc_credentials/home
# Requirements: Active Amazon Associates account in India with PA-API access.
# Host: webservices.amazon.in | Region: eu-west-1 (used for AWS SigV4 auth)
#
AMAZON_ACCESS_KEY=your_amazon_paapi_access_key_here
AMAZON_SECRET_KEY=your_amazon_paapi_secret_key_here
AMAZON_ASSOCIATE_TAG=your_store_tag-21

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. Flipkart Affiliate API
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Register / obtain at: https://affiliate.flipkart.com/api-docs
# Headers used: Fk-Affiliate-Id and Fk-Affiliate-Token
#
FLIPKART_AFFILIATE_ID=your_flipkart_affiliate_id_here
FLIPKART_AFFILIATE_TOKEN=your_flipkart_affiliate_token_here
